{
  "slug": "quick-question",
  "name": "Quick Question",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Unity Agent Harness for Claude Code. Auto-compiles C# on every edit, runs EditMode/PlayMode test pipelines with error checking, and performs deep code review using Claude subagents — with each finding independently verified against source before fixing. Includes tykit, an HTTP server inside Unity Editor for AI agent control (run tests, play/stop, read console, inspect GameObjects). 20 slash commands covering the full dev loop from edit to ship. Optional cross-model review via Codex CLI for teams that want multi-model verification. macOS, Unity 2021.3+.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **26 skills** and **4 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (26): `add-tests` (Author Unity EditMode, PlayMode, or regression tests for the current change without conflating that with test execution), `best-practice` (Quick Unity best-practice check — run after editing C# files to catch anti-patterns, performance issues, and runtime safety…), `bootstrap` (Decompose a high-level game vision (pillars + rules + references) into executable epics, then orchestrate the full qq…), `brief` (Compare the current branch against develop and generate two review documents: architecture change diagram + PR review checklist), `changes` (Summarize all changes Claude Code made during this conversation), `claude-code-review` (Deep code review via Claude subagent — reviews uncommitted changes by default, loops until no critical issues remain), `claude-plan-review` (Send a design document to a Claude subagent for review, then revise the document based on findings), `codex-code-review` (Cross-model code review via Codex CLI — reviews uncommitted changes by default, loops until no critical issues remain), and 18 more\n- **Hooks** (4): `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`, `Stop`, `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install quick-question@claude-community` from `tykisgod/quick-question`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 26,
    "hook": 4
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
